    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <strong>CrimeBot 2</strong>, the detective simulator where every clue can change the course of a case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze realistic crime scenes, interrogate suspects, and examine case files filled with photos, reports, and evidence. Every detail matters as you search for the killer in gripping investigations inspired by real-life cold cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Quick Match</strong> \u2013 Short but intense mysteries generated procedurally to sharpen your detective skills.<br>\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Story Mode</strong> \u2013 Travel through complex cases around the world, with deep narratives and shocking plot twists straight out of a thriller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbc <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic investigative simulator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cases inspired by unsolved real-life crimes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed case files with evidence, suspects, and photographs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogate suspects and try to incriminate or clear them by asking the right questions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that impact the progression of the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive, ad-free interface</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Made by just two passionate indie devs</strong>, pouring love and way too many coffees into every line of code.<br>\ud83d\udc8c <strong>We\u2019d be thrilled to hear your feedback</strong> \u2014 every review, message, and suggestion means the world to us. Thanks for being part of the investigation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 Download <strong>CrimeBot 2</strong> and prove you have the intuition needed to solve the most intricate crimes in the world of investigative games.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <strong>CrimeBot 2</strong>, the detective simulator where every clue can change the course of a case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Analyze realistic crime scenes, interrogate suspects, and examine case files filled with photos, reports, and evidence. Every detail matters as you search for the killer in gripping investigations inspired by real-life cold cases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two game modes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Quick Match</strong> \u2013 Short but intense mysteries generated procedurally to sharpen your detective skills.<br>\ud83d\udcd6 <strong>Story Mode</strong> \u2013 Travel through complex cases around the world, with deep narratives and shocking plot twists straight out of a thriller.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcbc <strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic investigative simulator</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cases inspired by unsolved real-life crimes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Detailed case files with evidence, suspects, and photographs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interrogate suspects and try to incriminate or clear them by asking the right questions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choices that impact the progression of the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive, ad-free interface</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Made by just two passionate indie devs</strong>, pouring love and way too many coffees into every line of code.<br>\ud83d\udc8c <strong>We\u2019d be thrilled to hear your feedback</strong> \u2014 every review, message, and suggestion means the world to us. Thanks for being part of the investigation!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc49 Download <strong>CrimeBot 2</strong> and prove you have the intuition needed to solve the most intricate crimes in the world of investigative games.</p>",
    "short_description": "A serial killer is on the loose. Only you can stop him! In CrimeBot 2, you analyze crime scenes, interrogate suspects, and connect the clues to solve cold cases around the world. The truth is hidden in the details.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Japanese, Indonesian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Thai, Turkish, Vietnamese",
    "reviews": "\u201cCrimeBot 2 delivers exactly what it promises: a solid detective game with many logical puzzles and cases staged in an exciting way. Although the graphics remain minimalist and the characters are somewhat unremarkable, the well-crafted gameplay and various game modes make this a hit title for puzzle enthusiasts. RoboBot Studio once again proves that even small developers can bring great ideas to life.\u201d<br>78/100 \u2013 Mediennerd<br><br>\u201cCrimebot 2 is part of that new breed of detective games that we could almost name Call-of-Cthulhu-likes (the tabletop, not the video game). You're presented with a case, a series of clues and documents, and from there, you have to unravel the mystery. No face-reading gimmicks where you try to see if your suspect is lying and no detective vision to help you out unfortunately.\u201d<br>Pocket Gamer<br>",
